    {
      "text": "keep thee in all places whither thou goest, Gen. 28:15. Let my son go, that he may serve me, Ex. 4:23. Let my people go, Ex. 5:1 (7:16; 8:1, 20; 9:1, 13; 10:3). speak unto … Israel, that they go forward, Ex. 14:15. Lord caused the sea to go back, Ex. 14:21. mine Angel shall go before thee, Ex. 23:23. thy God, he it is that doth go with thee, Deut. 31:6. whither thou goest, I will go, Ruth 1:16. go in the strength of the Lord God, Ps. 71:16. mercy and truth shall go before thy face, Ps. 89:14. Whither shall I go from thy spirit, Ps. 139:7. Train up a child in the way he should go, Prov. 22:6. let us go up to the mountain of the Lord, Isa. 2:3 (Micah 4:2; 2 Ne. 12:3). say to the prisoners, Go forth, Isa. 49:9 (1 Ne. 21:9). All we like sheep have gone astray, Isa. 53:6 (Mosiah 14:6). Lord said unto me, Go, prophesy, Amos 7:15.",
