      "text": "compel thee to go a mile, go with him twain, Matt. 5:41 (3 Ne. 12:41). I say to this man, Go, and he goeth, Matt. 8:9 (Luke 7:8). take up thy bed, and go, Matt. 9:6 (Mark 2:11; Luke 5:24). go rather to the lost sheep of … Israel, Matt. 10:6. Go ye therefore, and teach all nations, Matt. 28:19 (Mark 16:15; Morm. 9:22). thou shalt go before the face of the Lord, Luke 1:76. to whom shall we go, John 6:68. then I go unto him that sent me, John 7:33. I go my way, … whither I go, ye cannot come, John 8:21 (13:36). because I go unto my Father, John 14:12. If thou let this man go, thou art not Cæsar’s, John 19:12. manner as ye have seen him go into heaven, Acts 1:11. Arise, and go into the city, Acts 9:6 (22:10). let us go on unto perfection, Heb. 6:1. they have gone in the way of Cain, Jude 1:11.",
